  "termsBody": "PepMod is provided for educational and tracking purposes only. It is not a medical device and does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, prescriptions, or treatment recommendations. By using PepMod, you are responsible for your own records, decisions, and consultation with qualified healthcare professionals.\n\nSubscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled through the App Store or Google Play before the renewal period. Refunds are handled by the store where you purchased.\n\nFull Terms: https://appstorecopilot.com/legal/yzh32x5v/terms",
