    "description": "Educational half-life reference for Hexarelin."
  },
  "peptideContentHexarelinNotes": "Often cycled more conservatively than Ipamorelin due to potency and desensitisation concerns discussed in research communities.",
  "@peptideContentHexarelinNotes": {
    "description": "Neutral educational notes for Hexarelin; preserve non-prescriptive framing."
  },
  "peptideContentIgf1Lr3Description": "IGF-1 LR3 is a modified insulin-like growth factor-1 analogue with amino-acid substitutions that reduce binding-protein affinity and extend activity. It is discussed mostly in advanced performance and cell-growth research contexts.",
  "@peptideContentIgf1Lr3Description": {
